---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/homepage.css";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="HelpMeDost | Pareshani koi bhi ho, raasta zaroor milega"
  description="Students aur parents ke liye friendly, practical assistance. Apni problem batayein, clear next steps aur sahi guidance paayein."
>
  <section class="hm-hero">
    <div class="hm-container hm-hero-grid">
      <div class="hm-hero-copy">
        <div class="hm-kicker"><span class="hm-kicker-dot"></span> Aapka apna help platform</div>
        <h1>Har mushkil ka<br/><span>ek dostana raasta.</span></h1>
        <p class="hm-lead">School admission ho, kisi form mein confusion ho ya samajh na aaye kahan se shuru karein — apni baat humein batayein. Hum aapko sahi information aur agla practical step samajhne mein madad karenge.</p>
        <div class="hm-actions">
          <a class="hm-btn hm-btn-primary" href="/request-help">Madad shuru karein <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="hm-btn hm-btn-quiet" href="/track"><span class="hm-play" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span> Request track karein</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hm-reassurance"><span>✓ Aasaan process</span><span>✓ Clear guidance</span><span>✓ Ek jagah se shuruaat</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hm-hero-visual" aria-label="A friendly illustration representing help and guidance">
        <div class="hm-orbit hm-orbit-one"></div><div class="hm-orbit hm-orbit-two"></div>
        <div class="hm-sun"></div>
        <div class="hm-visual-card">
          <div class="hm-visual-top"><div class="hm-avatar">h<span>.</span></div><div><strong>HelpMeDost</strong><small>Yahin se shuruaat karein</small></div><span class="hm-online"></span></div>
          <div class="hm-chat hm-chat-user">Mujhe samajh nahi aa raha kya karun…</div>
          <div class="hm-chat hm-chat-answer"><span class="hm-answer-mark">✓</span><div><strong>Koi baat nahi. Hum hain na.</strong><p>Chaliye, ek-ek step samajhte hain.</p></div></div>
          <div class="hm-card-bottom"><span>Ek chhota step. Nayi shuruaat.</span><span>♥</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="hm-float hm-float-top"><span>✦</span> Guidance that feels human</div>
        <div class="hm-float hm-float-bottom"><span class="hm-float-icon">↗</span><div><strong>One step at a time</strong><small>Aap akele nahi hain</small></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hm-hero-wash"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="hm-trust-strip">
    <div class="hm-container hm-trust-inner"><span>HELP, WITHOUT THE HASSLE</span><i></i><span>Simple language</span><i></i><span>Practical next steps</span><i></i><span>People-first support</span></div>
  </section>

  <section class="hm-section" id="services">
    <div class="hm-container">
      <div class="hm-section-head"><div><div class="hm-kicker">Aapko kis cheez mein help chahiye?</div><h2>Jahan confusion ho,<br/><span>wahin se shuru karte hain.</span></h2></div><p>Abhi hamari pehli priority Student Help Portal hai. Baaki support areas ko hum carefully, step-by-step add karenge.</p></div>
      <div class="hm-service-grid">
        <a class="hm-service hm-service-featured" href="/request-help"><div class="hm-service-icon hm-icon-blue">✳</div><span class="hm-service-tag">Launch focus</span><h3>Student Help Portal</h3><p>School admission, EWS guidance, forms aur education-related processes ko samajhne mein practical help.</p><span class="hm-service-link">Student help explore karein <b>↗</b></span></a>
        <article class="hm-service"><div class="hm-service-icon hm-icon-peach">⌂</div><h3>Parent Guidance</h3><p>Bachchon ki education aur school matters mein information aur available options samajhne mein support.</p><span class="hm-coming">Planned service</span></article>
        <article class="hm-service"><div class="hm-service-icon hm-icon-mint">◎</div><h3>Digital Assistance</h3><p>Online forms, digital services aur technology ko safely use karne ki basic guidance.</p><span class="hm-coming">Planned service</span></article>
        <article class="hm-service"><div class="hm-service-icon hm-icon-lilac">♧</div><h3>Everyday Guidance</h3><p>Jab process confusing lage, possible next steps aur relevant information tak pahunchne mein help.</p><span class="hm-coming">Planned service</span></article>
      </div>
      <div class="hm-services-note"><span>✦</span> More support areas will be introduced in phases. We’ll keep the experience simple and useful.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hm-how" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="hm-container">
      <div class="hm-section-head hm-how-head"><div><div class="hm-kicker">Bas teen simple steps</div><h2>Madad maangna<br/><span>itna mushkil nahi.</span></h2></div><p>Aap apni baat share karein. Hum request ko organise karenge taaki aap uska update aasani se dekh sakein.</p></div>
      <div class="hm-steps">
        <article class="hm-step"><div class="hm-step-top"><span>01</span><div class="hm-step-icon">✎</div></div><h3>Apni baat batayein</h3><p>Problem ya question ko simple words mein share karein. Jitni zaroori details ho, utni hi dein.</p></article>
        <article class="hm-step"><div class="hm-step-top"><span>02</span><div class="hm-step-icon">⌑</div></div><h3>Reference number paayein</h3><p>Request submit hone par unique reference number milega. Use sambhal kar rakhein.</p></article>
        <article class="hm-step"><div class="hm-step-top"><span>03</span><div class="hm-step-icon">↗</div></div><h3>Update check karein</h3><p>Apne reference number se request ka status aur available updates check karein.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hm-bottom-cta">
    <div class="hm-container"><div class="hm-cta-card"><div class="hm-cta-decoration">h.</div><div class="hm-cta-copy"><div class="hm-kicker hm-kicker-light">Aaj hi pehla step lein</div><h2>Pareshani koi bhi ho,<br/>raasta zaroor milega.</h2><p>Aapki baat suni jaana zaroori hai. Shuruaat yahin se karein.</p></div><a class="hm-btn hm-btn-white" href="/request-help">Talk to HelpMeDost <span>↗</span></a></div></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
